{"c":[{"name":"20261005T224055Z-4008dd64a8214ebf","text":"Headless Chrome for Testing keeps calling Google hosts (google.com, googleapis.com) through a proxy whatever flags it gets; the F1 network sink (fixtures/web-form/oracle.ts) files them under browserService(), not offsite().","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T235610Z-e61928d562069b22","text":"H10: in the rig guest Mail has no account: opening an .eml shows the Add Account sheet, not the message; its SwiftUI buttons carry their label in AXDescription, not AXTitle.","type":"note"}]}
